WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:02.961
Let me read this CNN headline to you.

00:00:02.961 --> 00:00:04.295
Navajo Nation's

00:00:04.295 --> 00:00:06.965
objection to Landing Human Remains

00:00:06.965 --> 00:00:08.425
on the moon prompts last minute

00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:10.427
White House meeting.

00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:12.053
Now, to understand this, here's

00:00:12.053 --> 00:00:13.555
what you need to know.

00:00:13.555 --> 00:00:15.974
There are companies that will, for fee.

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:18.768
Fly your cremated remains to space.

00:00:18.768 --> 00:00:20.895
In this case, bury them on the moon.

00:00:20.895 --> 00:00:21.938
Two private companies

00:00:21.938 --> 00:00:23.732
that provide these lunar burial

00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:26.276
services, Celestis and Elysium Space

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:29.029
plan to send dozens of sets of human

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:30.697
remains on a lunar lander

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:33.033
set to launch on Monday.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.367
But the president of the Navajo

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.369
Nation says that turning the moon

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:37.871
into a burial ground

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:38.788
would be offensive

00:00:38.788 --> 00:00:40.415
to indigenous cultures.

00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:42.000
They've asked the White House and NASA

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.001
to delay the launch

00:00:43.001 --> 00:00:43.752
And consider

00:00:43.752 --> 00:00:45.336
this, that NASA apologized

00:00:45.336 --> 00:00:46.921
for doing something similar.

00:00:46.921 --> 00:00:48.882
More than 20 years ago,

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:49.507
in a statement,

00:00:49.507 --> 00:00:50.925
the CEO of Celestis says

00:00:50.925 --> 00:00:52.427
they reject the concerns.

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:54.220
The flight desecrates the moon.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.598
It is a touching and fitting celebration,

00:00:56.598 --> 00:00:57.140
he says.

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.516
For our participants,

00:00:58.516 --> 00:01:00.727
the exact opposite of desecration,

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:02.562
it is a celebration.

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:03.021
Joining me

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:04.814
now is the president of the Navajo

00:01:04.814 --> 00:01:07.067
Nation, Dr. Boot Nygren.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:07.275
Mr.

00:01:07.275 --> 00:01:09.277
President, thank you for being with me.

00:01:09.277 --> 00:01:09.944
Let me start here

00:01:09.944 --> 00:01:13.156
with just the explanation of why sending

00:01:13.156 --> 00:01:14.741
these human remains,

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:17.285
these capsules with DNA to the moon

00:01:17.285 --> 00:01:18.119
would be considered

00:01:18.119 --> 00:01:20.663
by the Navajo Nation and others

00:01:20.663 --> 00:01:24.459
a desecration of the moon.

00:01:24.542 --> 00:01:25.210
Good morning.

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:26.127
I appreciate

00:01:26.127 --> 00:01:27.504
the time that you all have given me.

00:01:27.504 --> 00:01:28.755
One of the first things,

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:29.589
as I explained,

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:30.882
we had a last minute meeting

00:01:30.882 --> 00:01:33.051
with the White House, NASA

00:01:33.051 --> 00:01:34.886
and Department of Transportation

00:01:34.886 --> 00:01:36.346
officials yesterday.

00:01:36.346 --> 00:01:37.931
And one of the things I explained to them

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:40.683
yesterday was that to over 20 years ago,

00:01:40.683 --> 00:01:41.976
you guys made a promise

00:01:41.976 --> 00:01:43.394
that after the fact that you set

00:01:43.394 --> 00:01:46.606
to the remains of an astronaut into space

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:47.941
and onto the moon,

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:49.818
that you promised to make sure

00:01:49.818 --> 00:01:51.945
that you can sort this into the future.

00:01:51.945 --> 00:01:55.657
But through the discussions yesterday,

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:56.616
through the

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:57.575
through the loopholes

00:01:57.575 --> 00:01:58.618
of private companies

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:00.745
that they can don't have to consult us.

00:02:00.745 --> 00:02:01.788
But they did promise

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:02.956
that moving into the future,

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:04.290
that they would consult us.

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:05.875
And one of the things I asked them

00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:07.627
is that you guys have a lot of influence

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:08.795
as far as NASA.

00:02:08.795 --> 00:02:10.296
Most of these missions won't happen

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:11.214
without the funding,

00:02:11.214 --> 00:02:12.173
the millions of dollars

00:02:12.173 --> 00:02:14.509
that help you launch these projects.

00:02:14.509 --> 00:02:16.636
So you should have a say in

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:17.929
trying to make sure that the

00:02:17.929 --> 00:02:19.639
that the promises that were made

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:22.433
over 20 years ago are upheld.

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:23.768
That's the logistics of this.

00:02:23.768 --> 00:02:24.352
But first,

00:02:24.352 --> 00:02:26.354
what is the cultural significance?

00:02:26.354 --> 00:02:29.858
What is what is the the deeply

00:02:29.858 --> 00:02:31.985
and profoundly, as you've said it,

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:34.112
disappointing desecration.

00:02:34.112 --> 00:02:38.116
If these remains were to go to the moon.

00:02:38.199 --> 00:02:40.535
One of the first and for a Navajo

00:02:40.535 --> 00:02:42.704
medicine man is called Hattersley

00:02:42.704 --> 00:02:43.913
and they

00:02:43.913 --> 00:02:46.207
they practice for many, many years.

00:02:46.207 --> 00:02:47.167
I just want to be upfront.

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:48.668
I'm not a medicine man,

00:02:48.668 --> 00:02:50.253
but one of the things that our elders

00:02:50.253 --> 00:02:51.254
and our across,

00:02:51.254 --> 00:02:52.088
these are medicine

00:02:52.088 --> 00:02:53.506
People have told me that

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:54.465
the moon is sacred.

00:02:54.465 --> 00:02:55.675
It's in our songs, it's

00:02:55.675 --> 00:02:57.886
in our stories, it's in our creation.

00:02:57.886 --> 00:02:59.512
We use the moon as a place

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:00.221
that we've looked to

00:03:00.221 --> 00:03:01.347
for hundreds of years

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:03.641
to make sure that we continue to exist.

00:03:03.641 --> 00:03:05.560
So they're part of ceremonies

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:06.895
that have been around

00:03:06.895 --> 00:03:07.812
with the Navajo people

00:03:07.812 --> 00:03:09.355
for a long, long time.

00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:10.815
So when this happened in the

00:03:10.815 --> 00:03:12.317
in the nineties,

00:03:12.317 --> 00:03:13.359
it was very clear

00:03:13.359 --> 00:03:15.195
that we should make sure that we consult

00:03:15.195 --> 00:03:16.029
our medicine people,

00:03:16.029 --> 00:03:17.197
consult the Navajo people

00:03:17.197 --> 00:03:18.698
before we do something like that.

00:03:18.698 --> 00:03:19.449
The Navajo Nation

00:03:19.449 --> 00:03:21.910
has never been opposed to exploration

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:24.120
or curiosity or space missions.

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:25.371
It's just the fact that

00:03:25.371 --> 00:03:28.750
the uniqueness of life is so important

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:30.460
that there's only one place,

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:31.920
no matter how far

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:33.421
into the universe we look,

00:03:33.421 --> 00:03:35.840
we have looked for decades now.

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:37.508
Now, with the technologies that we have,

00:03:37.508 --> 00:03:38.760
we haven't found human beings.

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:40.094
We haven't found another place

00:03:40.094 --> 00:03:40.887
like Earth.

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:42.013
So to us,

00:03:42.013 --> 00:03:43.223
it's we're very unique,

00:03:43.223 --> 00:03:44.474
were created here on Earth,

00:03:44.474 --> 00:03:46.267
and we should continue to exist

00:03:46.267 --> 00:03:46.893
here on Earth

00:03:46.893 --> 00:03:49.479
as we move along out of this life.

00:03:49.479 --> 00:03:50.521
So that's one of the things

00:03:50.521 --> 00:03:51.522
that have that

00:03:51.522 --> 00:03:52.815
the medicine men have told us.

00:03:52.815 --> 00:03:53.983
And then the fact that

00:03:53.983 --> 00:03:54.943
they're ceremonies

00:03:54.943 --> 00:03:56.402
that continue to exist here

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:57.695
within the Navajo Nation

00:03:57.695 --> 00:03:58.279
and across

00:03:58.279 --> 00:03:59.530
all indigenous cultures

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:01.282
that have looked to the skies for air

00:04:01.282 --> 00:04:04.160
for for for thousands of years,

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:06.079
and just to know to know

00:04:06.079 --> 00:04:07.872
that you have human remains

00:04:07.872 --> 00:04:09.040
circling the earth,

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:11.709
that's a little concerning

00:04:11.709 --> 00:04:12.460
to think about,

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:14.879
because a lot of us pray to the moon,

00:04:14.879 --> 00:04:15.713
pray to the moon,

00:04:15.713 --> 00:04:17.924
and that's the female counterpart of the

00:04:17.924 --> 00:04:21.302
sun in our culture. Mm hmm.

00:04:21.386 --> 00:04:22.512
You say that you were part

00:04:22.512 --> 00:04:23.596
of this meeting

00:04:23.596 --> 00:04:24.555
with NASA

00:04:24.555 --> 00:04:25.890
and the Department

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:27.892
of Transportation,

00:04:27.892 --> 00:04:28.810
Commerce Department,

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:30.687
FAA, other officials,

00:04:30.687 --> 00:04:32.021
the private company as well.

00:04:32.021 --> 00:04:33.731
What came out of this meeting?

00:04:33.731 --> 00:04:35.024
Can you tell us more about it?

00:04:35.024 --> 00:04:40.446
Will the launch be delayed?

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:42.282
I believe it was a meeting to kind of

00:04:42.282 --> 00:04:44.325
softly tell us that, you know what,

00:04:44.325 --> 00:04:45.285
we're sorry,

00:04:45.285 --> 00:04:47.537
but the launch is still going to happen.

00:04:47.537 --> 00:04:49.747
But one of the things that I requested

00:04:49.747 --> 00:04:51.165
is that we should have

00:04:51.165 --> 00:04:52.250
there's going to be a lot more,

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:53.668
as you mentioned earlier,

00:04:53.668 --> 00:04:54.419
throughout this year.

00:04:54.419 --> 00:04:54.711
And we

00:04:54.711 --> 00:04:55.670
and we only ask

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:56.713
that NASA fulfill

00:04:56.713 --> 00:04:58.214
its part of its promise.

00:04:58.214 --> 00:04:58.840
And one of the

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:00.550
I had a discussion after the meeting

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:02.635
with the NASA administrator, Mr.

00:05:02.635 --> 00:05:03.803
Nelson, and he did say,

00:05:03.803 --> 00:05:04.846
you know, I support you, Mr.

00:05:04.846 --> 00:05:05.763
President,

00:05:05.763 --> 00:05:07.140
but in return, I did ask him,

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:09.100
we should sit down and talk about that.

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:10.184
If NASA's going to be

00:05:10.184 --> 00:05:11.686
a part of any mission

00:05:11.686 --> 00:05:12.562
they should fulfill,

00:05:12.562 --> 00:05:13.855
even if it's a private company,

00:05:13.855 --> 00:05:15.982
because most of these private companies

00:05:15.982 --> 00:05:18.067
would probably not launch into space

00:05:18.067 --> 00:05:19.277
without the dollars

00:05:19.277 --> 00:05:19.944
that come along

00:05:19.944 --> 00:05:21.112
with partnering with NASA.

00:05:21.112 --> 00:05:23.114
So one of the things I ask is

00:05:23.114 --> 00:05:24.490
if NASA's going to be a part of it,

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:26.034
they should just have strict guidelines

00:05:26.034 --> 00:05:26.534
that said,

00:05:26.534 --> 00:05:27.827
you know what, We have a promise

00:05:27.827 --> 00:05:28.870
with indigenous people

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:30.913
that exist in the United States

00:05:30.913 --> 00:05:31.789
that we're not going to

00:05:31.789 --> 00:05:33.082
we're going to consult them

00:05:33.082 --> 00:05:34.208
and that we're going to make sure

00:05:34.208 --> 00:05:36.586
that human remains don't go into space.

00:05:36.586 --> 00:05:38.629
And I hope that those discussions

00:05:38.629 --> 00:05:40.715
actually come to fruition.

00:05:40.715 --> 00:05:42.091
Yeah, that commitment was made

00:05:42.091 --> 00:05:43.426
back in the nineties

00:05:43.426 --> 00:05:46.095
after a human remains were sent to

00:05:46.095 --> 00:05:47.013
the moon.

00:05:47.013 --> 00:05:49.390
A president of the Navajo Nation, Dr.

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:50.141
Bill Nygren,

00:05:50.141 --> 00:05:52.935
thank you so much for being with me.

00:05:53.019 --> 00:05:53.561
Thank you, sir.

